# Classic Era (Vanilla) build. The WoW client auto-loads this _Vanilla.toc on the
# Classic Era flavor; same folder, same shared Lua as retail and MoP Classic.
# Only Apprentice->Artisan gather ranks exist in Era - all covered by the shared
# spell table in Helpers.lua; higher-rank IDs simply never fire here.
# Interface current as of Classic Era patch 1.15.x (verified 2026-08-06 via
# warcraft.wiki.gg). If a patch flags "out of date", get the live number in-game
# with: /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo())
## Interface: 11509
## Title: Xal's Xpedited Routes
## Notes: Records gathering positions and displays them on the map and minimap, with an optimal-route compass - combining node-tracking and route optimization into one tool.
## Author: XalaMental
## X-Credits: Concept inspired by node-recording addons GatherMate2/Gatherer and route-optimization addon Routes.
